      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing-induced Pt segregation will produce a conformal, atomically dispersed Pt-enriched nanoshell.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Pt-enriched surface will lower the oxidation temperature relative to the unmodified catalyst.",
